  "question": {
    "text": "The atomic masses of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> are <math> <mn>7</mn> </math> and <math> <mn>39,</mn> </math> respectively. According to law of triads the atomic mass of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> will be",
