  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Atomic mass of middle element of triad is equal to average of masses of terminal elements.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Na&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>7</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>23</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>39</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>39</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math>",
